# The Unknown World's temple (K1, unk_m44aa its floor, unk_m44ab its
# catacombs, unk_m44ac its summit): the catacombs' tiles and the Builders'
# computer, Bastila on the summit (redeemed in word, fled: the light side),
# the field down, the Ebon Hawk mended and away to the Star Forge. Starts
# from the temple's door, either tribe's way in:
#   kjk playthrough k1 @uw_temple data/routes/k1/unknown_world_temple.route --god
exit unk44_basedoor@1    # down to the catacombs
save uw_catacombs
fight 25
# The tiles: each flips itself and its neighbours; the corners and the
# middle stepped on once, the rest twice or not at all, lights all nine.
# In from the east side, clear of the reset tile: 9, 8, 7, 8, 5, 2, 1, 2,
# 3. Solo mode keeps the others off them.
to 75.1,84.2
solo on
to 76.9,84.5
to 76.9,88.1
to 75.3,88.1
to 73.2,88.1
to 71.2,88.1
to 73.2,88.1
to 73.2,90.2
to 73.2,92.35
to 71.1,92.35
to 73.2,92.35
to 75.3,92.35
until UNK_TILES=1        # the nine lit (k_punk_floorNN): the computer's door opens
use unk44_rakcomp        # the Builders' computer: the summit opened
talk
solo off
save uw_library
exit RakataDoor4
fight 25
exit unk44_basedoor@2    # the summit
save uw_summit
# Bastila, Malak's now: the light side's answers. Her fight, then she flees
# to the Star Forge.
say no, bastila! don't go over to the dark side!
say it's not too late, bastila
say don't do this, bastila
say i draw my power from the light now
say that is how i know you will come back
say learn from my mistakes
say please, bastila
say the dark lord revan is dead
to unk44_bastcs
talk
fight 30
talk
save uw_bastila_fled
use RakatCom             # the disruptor field and the temple's shield down
talk
if UNK_SHIELD_OFF=0       # the exit trigger's line took the computer's turn (a
use RakatCom             # party member walked into it first): used again
talk
end
save uw_field_down
exit unk44_tpllckdoor    # down and out to the Ebon Hawk
exit unk44_exitdoor
exit unk41_goto41aad
to unk41_goebon
save uw_hawk
use Hyperdrive           # the stabilizers fitted
use ebo41_galaxymap      # the Star Forge
travel 10
talk
module ebo_m12aa
save star_forge
